'''Ronald''' (Japanese: '''ランド''' ''Lando'') is the [[rival]] of {{TCG GB|Mark}} and {{TCG GB|Mint}} in {{vg|Pokémon Trading Card Game}} and [[Pokémon Trading Card Game 2: The Invasion of Team GR!]]. In the second game, he infiltrates [[Team Great Rocket]] as the [[Enigmatic Mask]] '''GRX''' (Japanese: '''GRX''').

==In the games==
In both games, Ronald appears at some points and challenges the player to a duel that starts automatically, without any input from the player. Once Ronald appears and talks to the player, the player does not have the chance to perform common tasks like editing the deck or saving the game before dueling Ronald.

===Pokémon Trading Card Game===
As the player character's rival, he fights the player from time to time during the normal course of the gameplay.  He plays four different decks as the player progresses through the game.

====I'm Ronald Deck====
{{main|I'm Ronald Deck (TCG)}}

After the player obtains the second [[Master Medal]], Ronald will appear in the lobby of the club and battle the player with the {{TCG|I'm Ronald Deck}}. The player only has one chance to win this duel. Should the player be successful, the player will earn a promotional {{TCG ID|Wizards Promo|Jigglypuff|7}} card.

