==In the manga==
===Pokémon Card GB The Comix===
[[File:Ronald Pokémon Card GB The Comix.png|thumb|150px|Ronald in [[Pokémon Card GB The Comix]]]]
Ronald appears as the main character in [[Pokémon Card GB The Comix]], a one-shot manga based on the video game of the same name. In Pokémon Card GB The Comix, Ronald duels his rival {{TCG GB|Mark}}, but ultimately loses.

====Pokémon====
Ronald uses the following Pokémon cards in his duel against Mark:

